{{also|treehugger|tree-hugger}}
==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|en|treehugger|tree-hugger}}

===Etymology===
Compound of {{com|en|tree|hugger}}. Popularized after the 1970's [[Chipko]] movement in India, who resorted to actual group hugging of trees in order to prevent deforestation.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|En-au-tree hugger.ogg|Audio (AU)}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|slang|pejorative}} An [[environmental]] [[campaigner]], especially one who aims to [[restrict]] [[logging]].
# {{lb|en|slang}} A [[hippie]].{{rfex|en}}

